    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "SETUP REQUIRED BEFORE ACTIVATION\n1) Connect Google Calendar OAuth2 credentials to the Calendar node.\n2) Supabase REST API already points at the Manushyaa project. Create n8n Header Auth credentials for the apikey and Authorization headers; never paste service-role secrets into a committed JSON export.\n3) Grant the connected Google identity permission to read the official branch calendar.\n4) Put [DEADLINE] at the start of calendar event titles to route them into deadlines; other events become schedule rows.\n5) Test with a safe calendar event and verify the database result before activating.\n6) This starter upserts events; it does not delete Supabase rows when events disappear or are cancelled. Add reconciliation before treating it as authoritative.",
